@FTT.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5224

### 1. Register User
POST {{FTT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Bilawal Hussain",
  "username": "bilawal",
  "email": "bilawal@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "phoneNumber": "+92 300 1234567",
  "address": "Lahore, Pakistan",
  "avatarColor": "#2563EB"
}

### 2. Login User
POST {{FTT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "bilawal",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Get Current User Profile & Workspaces
GET {{FTT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### 4. Create Workspace
POST {{FTT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspace
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <token>

{
  "name": "Hussain Family",
  "description": "Family Task Tracker Workspace"
}

### 5. Get My Workspaces
GET {{FTT.Api_HostAddress}}/api/workspace
Authorization: Bearer <token>
